<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_WarmingEffect</defName>
    <label>暖脉丹药效</label>
    <description>以桃木正气温养经脉的前期丹药。活体萌螈服用后最低舒适温度降低15℃，持续2天；不治疗失温或冻伤。重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ComfyTemperatureMin>-15</ComfyTemperatureMin>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CoolingEffect</defName>
    <label>清暑丹药效</label>
    <description>以阴沉木调和暑热的前期丹药。活体萌螈服用后最高舒适温度提高15℃，持续2天；不治疗中暑、不增加煞气。重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ComfyTemperatureMax>15</ComfyTemperatureMax>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_IndustryEffect</defName>
    <label>百工丹药效</label>
    <description>温和提振专注的日常丹药。活体萌螈服用后全局工作速度×1.20，通用工作速度（含手工制作）与建造速度额外×1.15，研究速度额外×1.10（同条件研究综合×1.32），持续1天。无需开脉，不成瘾，重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>1.2</WorkSpeedGlobal>
          <ResearchSpeed>1.1</ResearchSpeed>
          <GeneralLaborSpeed>1.15</GeneralLaborSpeed>
          <ConstructionSpeed>1.15</ConstructionSpeed>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_RecoveryEffect</defName>
    <label>回气丹药效（旧版）</label>
    <description>旧版回气丹遗留的时限药效，载入后立即移除。当前回气丹为即时回复，无冷却。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CombatEffect</defName>
    <label>临战丹药效</label>
    <description>持续12小时。近战伤害×1.20，移速×1.15，瞄准时间×0.85，承伤×0.90。疼痛休克阈值+15个百分点，精神崩溃临界值降低10个百分点，近战命中和射击精度各+4点。随后6小时工作速度×0.90。药效和疲劳期间禁用。服用者须有一级以上仍可运转的灵螈脉络。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_CombatMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <PainShockThreshold>0.15</PainShockThreshold>
          <MentalBreakThreshold>-0.10</MentalBreakThreshold>
          <MeleeHitChance>4</MeleeHitChance>
          <ShootingAccuracyPawn>4</ShootingAccuracyPawn>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.2</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MoveSpeed>1.15</MoveSpeed>
          <AimingDelayFactor>0.85</AimingDelayFactor>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.9</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>1</minSeverity>
        <label>药后疲劳</label>
        <statFactors>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>0.9</WorkSpeedGlobal>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CapacityEffect</defName>
    <label>纳煞丹药效</label>
    <description>煞气稳定容量×1.50，持续10天。当前煞气不变。到期前24小时及1小时提示；到期容量下降可能导致超限。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_CapacityMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_PurifyEffect</defName>
    <label>涤煞丹药效</label>
    <description>持续10天，将当前煞气硬封顶至实时稳定容量的80%。低于上限不补煞。容量低于375时暂时抑制夜叉珍珠300下限，保留珍珠增长系数和剩余时长；不直接解除狂暴。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_PurifyMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_GatherEffect</defName>
    <label>聚煞丹药效</label>
    <description>服用后6小时内煞气增长×1.50。服用时即时补充最多300点煞气，补至容量的90%为止。涤煞丹生效时，补至容量的80%为止。冷却6小时。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <RM_MalevolentFactor>1.5</RM_MalevolentFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_DispelEffect</defName>
    <label>镇煞丹药效</label>
    <description>药效12小时。耗气攻击实中螈僵时，每次散去10点基础煞气，目标数量不限。同一目标的两次独立攻击至少间隔30游戏刻，同一次连击或齐射中的实际命中逐次结算。沿用本体飞僵和散煞倍率，以及夜叉珍珠的保底规则。攻击落空、护盾耗气、位移和持续伤害均不散煞。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
</Defs>
